<title>DENMARK: Danish April new car yr/yr sales rose 1.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Danish April new car yr/yr sales rose 1.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish new car registrations</p>
<p>rose 1.5 percent in April 1997 to 14,995 from 14,777 a year</p>
<p>earlier, the Automobile Importers' Society said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				     April 1997   April 1996</p>
<p>    New car registrations	14,995     14,777</p>
<p>Leading April registrations by manufacturer</p>
<p>    Volkswagen AG	   2,007</p>
<p>    General Motors Corp   1,689</p>
<p>    Ford Motor Co	   1,683</p>
<p>    Toyota		    1,473</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen Newsroom, +45-33-969650</p>
</text>
